      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The other thing is that you can build into the world a system that detects certain avatars and forces players into provided avatars with coliders at specific heights so that if the player leaves said colider(aka changes avatar) you can either force them back or push them out of the world. \nThis can be done with vrc_triggers but the actual force change or kick from world feature would have to be crowbared in, in a way probably  not intended by the devs.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
